              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "NurseJanice"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Nice change from the usual buttered popcorn. The only problem I had was that the popcorn needed to be stirred sooner than 5 minutes (more like 1-2 minutes) or it was going to burn. I also only roasted it for maybe about 8 minutes. By the way I was temped to skip the time in the oven and I am glad it did not, it mellowed the flavors and blended them nicely. Thanks for the recipe."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MINNIE000"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was really good and addictive. I made this with microwave popcorn and used about half the recommended spice/butter mixture for it. I also used seasoning salt instead of regular salt. I baked it but only for about 7 or so minutes as I got concerned about burning it. One thing I did do was line a baking sheet with some parchment paper before I put the popcorn down. This made removal easy because I was able to just lift out the parchment paper and it made cleanup even easier (no greasy pans). Thanks for the recipe!",
            "datePublished": "2009-09-02T20:59:12.690Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "HotTamale"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I’ve made this twice now and it is my go to late night snack recipe. Minimal effort and very quick. I half everything and still have plenty for about five people. I only stuck it in the oven for about six or seven minutes (one cause I’m impatient and two I was afraid of burning it) and it tasted wonderful. Try this recipe. You will not regret anything.",
            "datePublished": "2025-02-11T18:52:58.592Z"
          },
