              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SLJ6"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A 4 from the hubby....more like a 4-5 for me. Scaled down to two servings. Totally elimated the butter /margarine and eliminated the salt. Used Orville's Naturals lightly salted bag of popcorn ......which I shook the seasoning right in the bag of popped corn. I loved the spice of the cayenne and the tang of the lemon pepper. Yummy!",
            "datePublished": "2011-04-19T17:42:41.650Z"
